{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f6aad980-3975-895c-b748-f7b16334416d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:31:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Hold on, let me put this down. [pause] Okay. My trash wasn't picked up. Again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry to hear that. Can I get the address where it's supposed to be picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 80 Admiral Kalbfus Road. Up the North End. I put everything out last night like I'm supposed to, the barrel and the, um, the bags next to it, and it's three-thirty and it's all still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 80 Admiral Kalbfus Road. And Wednesday is your usual pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday, yes. Today. And it's the second time in a row they skipped me. Last week, same thing. I had to drag it all back by the garage and now I'm doing it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's two weeks running, last Wednesday and today. Did anything get left on the barrel, like a tag or a sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. Wait, hang on, I'm looking. [pause] No tag. Nothing. Sorry, I'm holding the, the dish towel, I'm in the middle of something. And the kids are home, winter break, so they're running around yelling, I can barely hear you. Hold on. Hey! Quiet, I'm on the phone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. I can hear them. I'll put in a report for a missed pickup at 80 Admiral Kalbfus Road, second miss in a row, no tag on the barrel. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can somebody come today, or do I just leave it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd leave it out where it is. I'll pass this to the crew supervisor so they can get a truck back to you or tell you what happened. I can't promise the exact time, but it'll be flagged as a repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just don't want it sitting out all week. It's not right, twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is 401-555-0162 the best number if they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the cell. That's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Thanks for calling, Mrs. Silva."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T15:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
